<title>JAPAN: Vietnam Oct-Mar Bach Ho premium unchanged--traders.</title>
<headline>Vietnam Oct-Mar Bach Ho premium unchanged--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Petro Vietnam Trading Co (Petechim) has decided to roll over its premium for October to March lifting of term Bach Ho crude at 63 cents per barrel, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The premium was over a published price assessment of Indonesia's Minas crude oil on a free-on-board basis.</p>
</text>
